      "explanation": "The doctor did not identify the risk that alprazolam and olanzapine were inpatient stat orders and instead suggested '暂时不要自行服药' which implies it can be resumed later, but never clarifies that these were not outpatient chronic medications. This is a serious error because it treats a stat prn as a long-term plan without confirming the official discharge prescription.",
